見親侍。乃留爲上征虜撫軍府板諮議，領記室。從還都，遷領軍司馬，中軍從事中郎。常在上府，參議機密。建元初，轉太子中庶子。世祖在東宮，專斷朝事，多不聞啓，晏慮及罪，稱疾自疏。尋領射聲校尉，不拜。世祖卽位，轉長兼侍中，意任如舊。","note":"按時序、詔書發言者或對照本傳。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan","book_id":"b-nanqishu-042","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-042-wangyan-ws1507997"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p003:r0001","surface":"晉熙王","start":1,"end":4,"person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p003","quote":"除晉熙王撫軍行參軍，安成王車騎參軍。建元初，爲長沙王後軍主簿，尚書殿中郎，出補竟陵王征北記室參軍，府遷司徒，仍爲錄事參軍。遷太子中舍人，文惠太子與竟陵王子良素好士，竝蒙賞接。思遠求出爲遠郡，除建安內史。長兄思玄卒，思遠友于甚至，表乞自解，不許。及祥日，又固陳，世祖乃許之。除中書郎，大司馬諮議。","note":"原句發言、受話或有據的府主。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan-ws2400356"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p002:r0052","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p002","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"晉熙王","person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"晉熙王征虜長史","note":"依句內語法、說話對象及本段承接辨識。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete-ws2261984"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p002:r0078","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p002","start":78,"end":81,"surface":"晉熙王","person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"晉熙王鎮西長史","note":"依句內語法、說話對象及本段承接辨識。","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete-ws2261984"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:r0027","surface":"晉熙王","start":27,"end":30,"person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","referent_role":"third_person","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002","quote":"晏字休默，一字士彥。仕宋，初爲建安國左常侍，稍至車騎，晉熙王燮安西板晏主簿，時齊武帝爲長史，與晏相遇。府轉鎭西，板晏爲記室。沈攸之事難，隨武帝鎭盆城。齊高帝時威權雖重，而眾情猶有疑惑，晏便專心奉事，軍旅書翰皆見委。性甚便僻，漸見親待，常參議機密。","note":"依本句及齊書卷42不同朝君主、親屬與說話位置。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangyan-ws1765279"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-nanqishu032-jinxi","person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","surfaces":["晉熙王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"medium","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081:m0132"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081","quote":"延之清貧，居宇穿漏。褚淵往候之，見其如此，具啓明帝，帝卽敕材官爲起三閒齋屋。遷侍中，領射聲校尉，未拜，出爲吳郡太守。罷郡還，家產無所增益。除吏部尚書，侍中，領右軍，竝不拜。復爲吏部尚書，領驍騎將軍，出爲後軍將軍、吳興太守。遷都督浙東五郡、會稽太守。轉侍中，祕書監，晉熙王師。遷中書令，師如故，未拜，轉右僕射。昇明二年，轉左僕射。"}],"rationale":"延之在宋明帝衛軍、建安王休仁府後任晉熙王師，繼而昇明任尚書左僕射。結合昶已北奔、宋廷以燮承襲晉熙爵，暫定受師者為燮。此為時序辨識，原句未直書燮，保留中等把握；不得反填延之受職於泰始六年。","references":[{"title":"《宋書》卷72正文","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1997159","source_revision":1997159,"source_position":{"first_line":91,"last_line":91},"quote":"昶知其不捷，乃夜與數十騎開門北奔索虜，棄母妻，唯攜愛妾一人，","wikitext_sha256":"cd2c4382536683f029cb539b03761e815ddbacd14695a3aedcf4ef51b559ebb3","image_verified":false,"scope":"parallel_primary_named_identity","note":"固定數位正文；未親核底本影像，數位校注所報異本不冒充親核。"},{"title":"《宋書》卷72正文","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1997159","source_revision":1997159,"source_position":{"first_line":93,"last_line":93},"quote":"泰始六年，以第六皇子燮字仲綏繼昶，改昶封為晉熙王。燮襲爵，食邑三千戶。","wikitext_sha256":"cd2c4382536683f029cb539b03761e815ddbacd14695a3aedcf4ef51b559ebb3","image_verified":false,"scope":"parallel_primary_named_identity","note":"固定數位正文；未親核底本影像，數位校注所報異本不冒充親核。"}],"human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081","text":"延之清貧，居宇穿漏。褚淵往候之，見其如此，具啓明帝，帝卽敕材官爲起三閒齋屋。遷侍中，領射聲校尉，未拜，出爲吳郡太守。罷郡還，家產無所增益。除吏部尚書，侍中，領右軍，竝不拜。復爲吏部尚書，領驍騎將軍，出爲後軍將軍、吳興太守。遷都督浙東五郡、會稽太守。轉侍中，祕書監，晉熙王師。遷中書令，師如故，未拜，轉右僕射。昇明二年，轉左僕射。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"延之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABAACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"褚淵","kind":"person","person_id":"jyx_72x_8t2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"明帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cti_o52_4nz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081:m0132","start":132,"end":135,"surface":"晉熙王","kind":"person","person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":81,"last_line":81,"revision_id":1513918,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p003","text":"晉熙王燮爲郢州，晏爲安西主簿。世祖爲長史，與晏相遇。府轉鎮西，板晏記室諮議。沈攸之事難，鎮西職僚皆隨世祖鎮盆城，上時權勢雖重，而衆情猶有疑惑，晏便專心奉事，軍旅書翰皆委焉。性甚便僻，漸見親侍。乃留爲上征虜撫軍府板諮議，領記室。從還都，遷領軍司馬，中軍從事中郎。常在上府，參議機密。建元初，轉太子中庶子。世祖在東宮，專斷朝事，多不聞啓，晏慮及罪，稱疾自疏。尋領射聲校尉，不拜。世祖卽位，轉長兼侍中，意任如舊。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p003:m0003","surface":"燮","start":3,"end":4,"person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p003:m0008","surface":"晏","start":8,"end":9,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p003:m0022","surface":"晏","start":22,"end":23,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan:p003:m0032","surface":"晏","start":32,"end":33,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"cont