出補竟陵王征北記室參軍，府遷司徒，仍爲錄事參軍。遷太子中舍人，文惠太子與竟陵王子良素好士，竝蒙賞接。思遠求出爲遠郡，除建安內史。長兄思玄卒，思遠友于甚至，表乞自解，不許。及祥日，又固陳，世祖乃許之。除中書郎，大司馬諮議。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p003:m0076","surface":"子良","start":76,"end":78,"person_id":"x3q_cqm_dup","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p003:m0087","surface":"思遠","start":87,"end":89,"person_id":"0cf_pqs_mnm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p003:m0103","surface":"思玄","start":103,"end":105,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABCA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan:p003:m0107","surface":"思遠","start":107,"end":109,"person_id":"0cf_pqs_mnm","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2400356,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":74,"last_line":74,"line_start":2,"line_end":149,"raw_start":4293,"raw_end":4440,"raw_character_offsets":[4293,4294,4295,4296,4297,4298,4299,4300,4301,4302,4303,4304,4305,4306,4307,4308,4309,4310,4311,4312,4313,4314,4315,4316,4317,4318,4319,4320,4321,4322,4323,4324,4325,4326,4327,4328,4329,4330,4331,4332,4333,4334,4335,4336,4337,4338,4339,4340,4341,4342,4343,4344,4345,4346,4347,4348,4349,4350,4351,4352,4353,4354,4355,4356,4357,4358,4359,4360,4361,4362,4363,4364,4365,4366,4367,4368,4369,4370,4371,4372,4373,4374,4375,4376,4377,4378,4379,4380,4381,4382,4383,4384,4385,4386,4387,4388,4389,4390,4391,4392,4393,4394,4395,4396,4397,4398,4399,4400,4401,4402,4403,4404,4405,4406,4407,4408,4409,4410,4411,4412,4413,4414,4415,4416,4417,4418,4419,4420,4421,4422,4423,4424,4425,4426,4427,4428,4429,4430,4431,4432,4433,4434,4435,4436,4437,4438,4439],"projection_sha256":"eae55a8615d6561459e79b7562e47ca4bd81fee42e81779b45eeb2dc54e6174b","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan-ws2400356"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete:p002","text":"解褐著作佐郎，太子舍人，安陸王冠軍主簿，太子洗馬，本州別駕，中書郎，桂陽王司空諮議，黃門郎。元徽元年，爲晉熙王征虜長史、江夏內史，遷侍中，領步兵校尉。復出爲晉熙王鎮西長史，加冠軍將軍、江夏武昌太守。徵祠部尚書，轉掌吏部。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":13,"last_line":13,"raw_start":227,"raw_end":337,"raw_character_offsets":[227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306,307,308,309,310,311,312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322,323,324,325,326,327,328,329,330,331,332,333,334,335,336],"revision_id":2261984},"mentions":[],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-complete-ws2261984"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002","text":"晏字休默，一字士彥。仕宋，初爲建安國左常侍，稍至車騎，晉熙王燮安西板晏主簿，時齊武帝爲長史，與晏相遇。府轉鎭西，板晏爲記室。沈攸之事難，隨武帝鎭盆城。齊高帝時威權雖重，而眾情猶有疑惑，晏便專心奉事，軍旅書翰皆見委。性甚便僻，漸見親待，常參議機密。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0000","surface":"晏","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0002","surface":"休默","start":2,"end":4,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0007","surface":"士彥","start":7,"end":9,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0030","surface":"燮","start":30,"end":31,"person_id":"635_2fb_cfw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0034","surface":"晏","start":34,"end":35,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0047","surface":"晏","start":47,"end":48,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0057","surface":"晏","start":57,"end":58,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0062","surface":"沈攸之","start":62,"end":65,"person_id":"16c_0og_lvl_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan:p002:m0092","surface":"晏","start":92,"end":93,"person_id":"i08_s4b_5bb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1765279,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":95,"last_line":95,"line_start":0,"line_end":123,"raw_start":4014,"raw_end":4137,"raw_character_offsets":[4014,4015,4016,4017,4018,4019,4020,4021,4022,4023,4024,4025,4026,4027,4028,4029,4030,4031,4032,4033,4034,4035,4036,4037,4038,4039,4040,4041,4042,4043,4044,4045,4046,4047,4048,4049,4050,4051,4052,4053,4054,4055,4056,4057,4058,4059,4060,4061,4062,4063,4064,4065,4066,4067,4068,4069,4070,4071,4072,4073,4074,4075,4076,4077,4078,4079,4080,4081,4082,4083,4084,4085,4086,4087,4088,4089,4090,4091,4092,4093,4094,4095,4096,4097,4098,4099,4100,4101,4102,4103,4104,4105,4106,4107,4108,4109,4110,4111,4112,4113,4114,4115,4116,4117,4118,4119,4120,4121,4122,4123,4124,4125,4126,4127,4128,4129,4130,4131,4132,4133,4134,4135,4136],"projection_sha256":"7faeff5b7f314d5ab25fa00593dd0ec562e718c3d1a7980d1f985e42026c8291","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-024-wangyan","book_id":"b-nanshi-024","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-024-wangyan-ws1765279"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi","source":{"title":"《南齊書》卷32（王延之傳）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E9%BD%8A%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B732&oldid=1513918","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E9%BD%8A%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B732&oldid=1513918","revision_id":1513918,"accessed_on":"2026-10-19","extent":"王延之傳及子倫之附傳完整七原段；未錄同卷其他本傳。","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，未親核底本影像","response_sha256":"f428c7546fdd70a9eece664401433407aad6e45bcbe711a6d58ef8806c1b4ca0","wikitext_sha256":"cc9c36ced8f64c3c359c76836ae56968c8a13c4a3b3c19a416575737314b0061","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"只去段首排版空白、展開單參數年號模板；原字不作簡繁或異體替換。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line077","source_lines":[77,77],"raw_quote":"　　王延之字希季，琅邪臨沂人也。祖裕，宋左光祿儀同三司。父昇之，都官尚書。延之出繼伯父秀才粲之。","raw_quote_sha256":"63309c01db8bf8d6b5f83bb589c818356474dc0c389aa17435d5c9adc71c951b","selected_text_sha256":"5190227dee6f7bb18e8210dd652ad8fdc41e010edd497de276a9bd0d34e01224","begin_anchor":"王延之字希季，琅邪臨沂人也。祖裕，宋","end_anchor":"之，都官尚書。延之出繼伯父秀才粲之。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line079","source_lines":[79,79],"raw_quote":"　　延之少而靜默，不交人事。州辟主簿，不就。舉秀才。除北中郎法曹行參軍，轉署外兵尚書外兵部，司空主簿，竝不就。除中軍建平王主簿、記室，仍度司空、北中郎二府，轉祕書丞，西陽王撫軍諮議，州別駕，尋陽王冠軍、安陸王後軍司馬，加振武將軍，出爲安遠護軍，武陵內史，不拜。宋明帝爲衞軍，延之轉爲長史，加宣威將軍。司徒建安王休仁征赭圻，轉延之爲左長史，加寧朔將軍。","raw_quote_sha256":"65dbf92687392816270499d64b3b3f76669ef41d680d8463027ded366be3be20","selected_text_sha256":"debc76a5cc02e53dcb238a4a8c76e6863282a68a59b11477f6f7f66b00b5e843","begin_anchor":"延之少而靜默，不交人事。州辟主簿，不","end_anchor":"征赭圻，轉延之爲左長史，加寧朔將軍。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line081","source_lines":[81,81],"raw_quote":"　　延之清貧，居宇穿漏。褚淵往候之，見其如此，具啓明帝，帝卽敕材官爲起三閒齋屋。遷侍中，領射聲校尉，未拜，出爲吳郡太守。罷郡還，家產無所增益。除吏部尚書，侍中，領右軍，竝不拜。復爲吏部尚書，領驍騎將軍，出爲後軍將軍、吳興太守。遷都督浙東五郡、會稽太守。轉侍中，祕書監，晉熙王師。遷中書令，師如故，未拜，轉右僕射。{{YL|昇明二年}}，轉左僕射。","raw_quote_sha256":"9ca43034f43d6d2aa684144449f398b4160a868f311a0735a24990a2063d77ce","selected_text_sha256":"58b8ffd38c297992f6d74e43e4f321eeb4c7885b70ba017250113c7f5cc8d849","begin_anchor":"延之清貧，居宇穿漏。褚淵往候之，見其","end_anchor":"未拜，轉右僕射。昇明二年，轉左僕射。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line083","source_lines":[83,83],"raw_quote":"　　宋德旣衰，太祖輔政，朝野之情，人懷彼此。延之與尚書令王僧虔中立無所去就，時人爲之語曰：「二王持平，不送不迎。」太祖以此善之。三年，出爲使持節、都督江州豫州之新蔡晉熙二郡諸軍事、安南將軍、江州刺史。{{YL|建元二年}}，進號鎮南將軍。","raw_quote_sha256":"0cd884fa9eb1203fb545131432a7d48211f9d992426485fd8b5b45330090963e","selected_text_sha256":"ea7c152f4e5a264eb70b2e46add02732d7f7a4915e5df75bbd6dc721f5c2d5ab","begin_anchor":"宋德旣衰，太祖輔政，朝野之情，人懷彼","end_anchor":"、江州刺史。建元二年，進號鎮南將軍。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line085","source_lines":[85,85],"raw_quote":"　　延之與金紫光祿大夫阮韜，俱宋領軍劉湛外甥，竝有早譽。湛甚愛之，曰：「韜後當爲第一，延之爲次也。」延之甚不平。每致餉下都，韜與朝士同例。太祖聞其如此，與延之書曰：「韜云卿未嘗有別意，當緣劉家月旦故邪？」在州祿俸以外，一無所納，獨處齋內，吏民罕得見者。","raw_quote_sha256":"1b62157340ff787ebef58d5c05857a2b7104fd16ee3c1d3f38064ea29f5d3a5f","selected_text_sha256":"90909962f1db802e4a30a46ab7a5cb67214e9a90572e891e287cff72fa8b6ee0","begin_anchor":"延之與金紫光祿大夫阮韜，俱宋領軍劉湛","end_anchor":"，一無所納，獨處齋內，吏民罕得見者。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line087","source_lines":[87,87],"raw_quote":"　　四年，遷中書令，右光祿大夫，本州大中正。轉左僕射，光祿、中正如故。尋領竟陵王師。永明二年，陳疾解職，世祖許之。轉特進，右光祿大夫，王師、中正如故。其年卒，年六十四。追贈散騎常侍，右光祿大夫、特進如故。諡簡子。","raw_quote_sha256":"748493c1959b643774874ba6bac9520e23f70d42b43e50c0d5c8ca10373a185a","selected_text_sha256":"cc17b4ba7f4714e314638e533f6a50993fa06f0b9d08799957fd0284b9a5955a","begin_anchor":"四年，遷中書令，右光祿大夫，本州大中","end_anchor":"常侍，右光祿大夫、特進如故。諡簡子。"},{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangyanzhi:line089","source_lines":[89,89],"raw_quote":"　　延之家訓方嚴，不妄見子弟，雖節歲問訊，皆先克日。子倫之，見兒子亦然。永明中，爲侍中。世祖幸琅邪城，倫之與光祿大夫全景文等二十一人坐不參承，爲有司所奏。詔倫之親爲陪侍之職，而同外惰慢，免官，景文等贖論。建武中，至侍中，領前軍將軍，都官尚書，領游擊將軍，卒。","raw_quote_sha256":"38237b355b070140f7c7665ebb14b1b640966bac3ad6a6c8afb031283de0c536","selected_text_sha256":"49405af16fd46e757a1419ca1a21f4ecd0c4aec760759c6727ed53bbcb362ce5","begin_anchor":"延之家訓方嚴，不妄見子弟，雖節歲問訊","end_anchor":"前軍將軍，都官尚書，領游擊將軍，卒。"}]}}},{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-042","source_id":"s-nanqishu-042-wangyan-ws1507997","source":{"title":"南齊書卷42·王晏","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1507997","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1507997","revision_id":1507997,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","edition":"維基文庫固定數位轉錄","extent":"第11至25行八段，德元27行、詡29行另見已發附傳。","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","image_verified":false,"review_status":"text_checked","raw_path":"source-evidence/nanshi019-xietiao/nanqishu042-ws1507997.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"0dcd8247799793e88edf3bee9a4b72eb5e0b0097a2bd2b84c8888c828c95feac","rights":"古代原典及維基文庫數位轉錄。","license_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/Wikisource:著作權資訊","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"投影相應原句，保留字形；移除年號模板定界符。"},"section_locator":"王晏","related_excerpt":{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-042-wangyan-father-and-grandfather","source_line":11,"relation":"same_digital_witness_previously_issued_excerpt"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-043","source_id":"s-nanqishu-043-wangsiyuan-ws2400356","source":{"title":"南齊書卷43·王思遠","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2400356","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2400356","revision_id":2400356,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","edition":"維基文庫固定數位轉錄","extent":"固定修訂70至86行。88行顧暠之、90行王思微各有獨立篇。","text_scope":"complete_biography_unit","image_verified":false,"review_status":"text_checked","raw_path":"sources/